OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy to start with rain in
OL,6,Fthe west. Patchy rain becomes more
OL,7,Fwidespread through the morning and
OL,8,Finto the afternoon. Breezy throughout
OL,9,Fthe day, turning gusty around the
OL,10,Fcoast. Very mild for the time of year.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FRemaining mostly cloudy with
OL,13,Fpatchy light rain initially. The odd
OL,14,Fclear spell develops overnight with
OL,15,Fmany areas turning dry. Mild. Strong,
OL,16,Fgusty winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
