OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FCloudy and dry initially with
OL,6,Fa band of rain, locally heavy,
OL,7,Farriving by late morning. This clears
OL,8,Fby mid-afternoon with a dry afternoon
OL,9,Ffollowing. Remaining windy. Very mild.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,12,FGenerally dry and partly cloudy on
OL,13,FWednesday and Thursday but remaining
OL,14,Fwindy. Rain through Friday morning
OL,15,Fthen turning drier and brighter later,
OL,16,Fwinds easing. Mild through the period.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
